foliate (1:3.3.0-1) bionic; urgency=medium

  * Local build.
  * The epoch is deliberate: the distribution ships foliate as
    4.~really3.3.0-1build1, a version that sorts higher than a plain 3.3.0,
    so without it apt quietly reinstalls the distro package on top of a
    locally built one (see /var/log/dpkg.log) and the installed copy ends up
    being the unmodified upstream code.
  * The Show Reading Marker preference is a slide toggle now, not a checkbox.

